/T (When an earthquake occurs, staying calm and following appropriate safety procedures are essential. If indoors, remain inside, stay away from windows, and take cover under sturdy furniture. If outdoors, move away from buildings, trees, and power lines when safe. People travelling in vehicles should pull over safely and remain inside until the shaking stops. Avoid elevators and follow safety instructions from responsible authorities.)
