/Title (Our goal is to improve earthquake awareness and preparedness by sharing historical events, real-life data, local hazard information, and effective mitigation strategies. We also aim to educate individuals about emergency planning, essential safety procedures, and the importance of community participation in reducing disaster risks. Ultimately, we hope to contribute to a safer and more resilient Myanmar.)
