/Title (Earthquakes can occur suddenly and cause serious damage to buildings, infrastructure, and surrounding communities. Knowing the correct safety procedures before, during, and after an earthquake is essential for reducing injuries, protecting lives, and preventing further risks. Proper preparation and awareness can help individuals respond more confidently and make safer decisions during emergencies.)
