1010 0 obj
<<
/Title (Preparing for an earthquake in advance helps reduce risks and protect lives. Individuals and families should keep essential emergency supplies ready, create communication plans, and identify safe meeting locations. An emergency kit should include drinking water, food, a first-aid kit, a flashlight, a radio, and important documents to support basic needs for at least three days)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 993 0 R
/Next 1021 0 R
>>
endobj
1011 0 obj
<<
/Title (Preparedness Checklists & Recovery)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 993 0 R
/Prev 1022 0 R
/First 1023 0 R
/Last 1023 0 R
/Count -1
>>
endobj
1012 0 obj
<<
/Title (Understanding how to react at each stage of an earthquake is an important part of disaster risk reduction. From preparing emergency supplies and identifying safe locations to following evacuation instructions and checking for hazards afterward, every step contributes to personal and community safety.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 941 0 R
/Prev 994 0 R
/Next 1024 0 R
>>
endobj
1013 0 obj
<<
/Title (During the crisis)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 941 0 R
/Prev 1024 0 R
/First 1025 0 R
/Last 1025 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 995 0 R
>>
endobj
1014 0 obj
<<
/Title (After the shaking stops, check for injuries and possible hazards. Be prepared for aftershocks, avoid damaged structures, and follow official emergency updates. Contact emergency services when necessary and return to buildings only when authorities confirm they are safe.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 995 0 R
/Next 1015 0 R
>>
endobj
1015 0 obj
<<
/Title (When an earthquake occurs, staying calm and following appropriate safety procedures are essential. If indoors, remain inside, stay away from windows, and take cover under sturdy furniture. If outdoors, move away from buildings, trees, and power lines when safe. People travelling in vehicles should pull over safely and remain inside until the shaking stops. Avoid elevators and follow safety instructions from responsible authorities.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 995 0 R
/Prev 1014 0 R
/First 1026 0 R
/Last 1027 0 R
/Count -10
>>
endobj
