1023 0 obj
<<
/Title (Regularly check emergency supplies, update family plans, and practise safety procedures. After an earthquake, follow official instructions and seek assistance when needed. Proper preparation and community cooperation can help reduce earthquake impacts and support safer recovery.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1011 0 R
>>
