1024 0 obj
<<
/Title (When the ground shakes)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 941 0 R
/Prev 1012 0 R
/Next 1013 0 R
>>
endobj
1025 0 obj
<<
/Title (Preparation begins before an earthquake occurs. Individuals should secure heavy furniture, identify safe spots in each room, prepare emergency kits, and establish family communication plans. Practising earthquake drills also helps everyone understand what to do when shaking begins. During an earthquake, remember to **Drop, Cover, and Hold On** to protect yourself from falling objects and reduce the risk of injury.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1013 0 R
>>
endobj
